Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 14:25:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-223A: per-effect GPU time in the perf log,
 Bench.log writer for the menu's cost measurement

- Stage timing lanes keep a per-window average (WindowTake); g_gxStageTimes seam; the perf log writes
  gpu_stages_ms name=ms for every Vulkan effect stage that ran in the window
- hdBenchLog: a line set there is appended to Logs\Bench.log (ZepHDOptions.lua Measure Costs)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UHcJJVC4feQ4s15e9bNRoN
